{"id":"embargo","lemma":"embargo","pos":"noun","rank":602,"glosses":["embargo","trade embargo","distraint"],"ipa":"/emˈbaɾɡo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"embargos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-embargo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es sin embargo cierto.","en":"It is nonetheless true.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/702877","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"a certain, a specific"}]},{"text":"Hay una solución sin embargo.","en":"There is a solution though.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"solution"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Él le disparó al pájaro, sin embargo falló.","en":"He shot at the bird, but missed it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1190580","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to shoot, to fire","l":"disparar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"bird"},{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"to fail","l":"fallar"}]},{"text":"Sin embargo todavía tienes toda una vida por delante.","en":"You've still got all your life in front of you.","words":[{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"life"},null,null],"phrases":[[7,9,"forward"]]},{"text":"Él prometió volver y sin embargo no lo hizo.","en":"He promised to return and yet he didn't.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to promise","l":"prometer"},{"g":"to return"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]}]}